{
  "abstract": "{\"capability_summary\":\"全量更新微信小程序信息，需上传全部要更新的信息。可配合【获取Access token】接口获取授权access_token，细分类型ID详见【应用管理标签及类目】文档。\",\"id\":\"tools.wechat_applet.update\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v3.0/tools/wechat_applet/update/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1771744756803659\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"tools.get_access_token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要通过此接口获取授权access_token\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"},{\"id\":\"tools.application_management_labels_and_categories\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1812331394774028?origin=left_nav\",\"reason\":\"更新时细分类型需填写此文档中的末级分类ID\",\"relation\":\"配合文档\",\"title\":\"应用管理标签及类目\"},{\"id\":\"tools.return_codes\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"应答中的返回码和返回信息需参考此文档\",\"relation\":\"配合文档\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1771744756803659\",\"title\":\"更新微信小程序\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-GHKjB2HM\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-89mKBDHd\">全量更新接口，请上传您需要更新的全部信息</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201771123092443139%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-U6H1B2bV\" id=\"h346b9f0-U6H1B2bV\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-PRec52QD\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/tools/wechat_applet/update/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/tools/wechat_applet/update/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1771744756803659\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-hH6Zl50N\" id=\"h346b9f0-hH6Zl50N\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-5QibPYaP\">POST</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-ZMdW7gX4\" id=\"h346b9f0-ZMdW7gX4\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section c