/section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-fqitIxGk\">客户ID</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">instance_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-3YVwVOWI\">小程序资产ID</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">remark_message</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-0Tb0T1VQ\">资产备注信息，最大长度不超过15</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">icon_image_url</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-iO82cQpf\">小程序icon图片的url，尺寸60*60px,大小不超2MB</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-tu9w60sA\">图片格式要求jpeg、png或gif</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">header_image_url</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-oPFAU3vq\">顶部头图的url，大小不超过5MB的图片，推荐尺寸2:1</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-JMyxWFJS\">图片格式要求jpeg、png或gif</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">labels</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-wnfjrLwZ\">小程序标签，每个标签长度不超过6，最多支持6个标签</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">guide_text</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Q7lp0SxZ\">引导文案，最大长度不超过14</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">images_vertical_url</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-OVXcGQk1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-WA8bVJiV\">小程序竖图的url地址，要求尺寸必须为3:5，否则报错。</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-uaeahj4N\">仅支持竖图和横图择其一类型上传，若同时上传两种类型的图片则报错</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-a8OApxh3\">小程序横图或竖图上传最少3张，最多8张，大小不超过5MB</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-H1JmZf60\">图片格式要求jpeg、png或gif</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">images_horizontal_url</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-foCkek4C\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-sY3mS08Q\">小程序横图的url地址，要求尺寸必须为3:5，否则报错。</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-uBNBeUGE\">仅支持竖图和横图择其一类型上传，若同时上传两种类型的图片则报错</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-eG8KCOxS\">小程序横图或竖图上传最少3张，最多8张，大小不超过5MB</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-3dmfgInL\">图片格式要求jpeg、png或gif</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">introduction</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-FFQQILJD\">小程序简介，最大长度不超过50</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">tag_info</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-bxZEXD3v\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-P09XZBiw\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-mme1GadX\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-hL1LhVGj\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-NLcafve4\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-MWuYxIig\">细分类型</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-l7dWNBe3\">填写细分类型的末级分类ID，详见<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1812331394774028?origin=left_nav\" target=\"_blank\">【应用管理标签及类目】</a></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-6YyROO7c\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-eWA2gtKL\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-E8wkIgHe\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-suRb9mGb\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-EaJpdAFV\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-YNSwn2eR\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-u968rOuI\"></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">payment_form</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag success\">条件必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-XQjiS41u\">付费形式</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-aIB7IWr7\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-a6CPklhF\">支持类目：工具、社交，该类目下必填</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-QeX65F48\">可选值:</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-lA7Gg2ER\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-OjNSSl3g\"><code>BOTH_OPTIONS_AVAILABLE</code> 以上两者兼有</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Af3B45TL\"><code>CONTENT_OR_SERVICES</code> 付费购买内容或服务</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-SKoRZLjT\"><code>UNLOCK_FULL_FEATURES</code> 付费解锁完整功能</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">membership_type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag success\">条件必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-7GJ7Tmmq\">会员类型</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-OachpSqb\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ezSLxuhJ\">支持类目：工具、社交，该类目下必填</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-fYPcxtT1\">可选值:</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-UXGEQFQC\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-PRNJjAZO\"><code>ANNUAL</code> 年度</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-BnqSIHJl\"><code>LIFETIME</code> 终身</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-LThHXh1f\"><code>MONTHLY</code> 月度</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Hb1NKNJK\"><code>NONE</code> 无</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Ud4gb0WI\"><code>WEEKLY_DAILY</code> 周/天</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">revenue_model</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag success\">条件必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-1Pp6bSTZ\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-o7MSX1lc\">变现模式</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-g14ep4Zd\">支持类目：工具、社交、游戏道具售卖，该类目下必填</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-LcDcBUK7\">可选值:</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58